  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Training - ECP Gas Workshop Series, through U.S. Chamber of Commerce</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">USTDA funding is supporting a series of eight technical workshops on gas-related topics for officials from the National Energy Administration and other sector stakeholders. The workshops will serve as forum where representatives from U.S. industry and government engage Chinese counterparts to collaborate on best practices, standards and policy development, and commercial opportunities within the gas sector.</narrative>
